OL,3,GNEWSAProposal to hike Sark taxes to
OL,4,Afund major projects
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxes could go up in Sark by 7.5% to
OL,7,Ffund major projects including the
OL,8,Fupgrade of a link between two islands.
OL,10,FThe Policy and Finance Committee said
OL,11,Fthe increases could include personal
OL,12,Fcapital tax and property tax rates.
OL,14,FIt would be used to help fund
OL,15,F"investment in major projects such as
OL,16,Fthe next phase of stability works at La
OL,17,FCoupee [which connects Little Sark and
OL,18,FBig Sark], harbour infrastructure
OL,19,Fimprovements, and waste management
OL,20,Fupgrades", the Chief Pleas said.
